        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://exploreforts.com/forts/fort-ashby-wv"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The only major battle at Fort Ashby occurred in 1756 when French and Native American forces defeated a company of rangers.",
